    "title": "Fahlo Animal Tracker",
    "description": "At Fahlo, we partner with nonprofits to support their work protecting endangered species, preserving habitats, and promoting peaceful human-animal coexistence.\r\nBy pairing thoughtfully-designed products with the ability to track real animals on an interactive map, we\u2019re giving everyone an opportunity to make an impact. Each purchase gives back and reveals your animal\u2019s name, photo, story, and path with fun updates along the way!\r\nSince our start in 2018, Fahlo has donated over $2 million to conservation partners, which is pretty exciting considering our team is 80% penguins in trench coats.\r\nThe more opportunities to educate and excite others about saving wildlife, the bigger the difference we make for generations to come.",
